{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1001", "sample_idx": 26, "model_name": "stockmark/stockmark-2-100b-instruct", "content": "Let us begin with the city of Tokyo, where our journey shall commence,\nUpon the morrow, the tower of Tokyo Skytree we shall ascend,\nThe following day, the gardens of Shinjuku Gyoen we will traverse,\nAnd in the evening, the theater of Kabuki will entertain our senses,\n\nFrom Tokyo, we will venture to Kyoto, the city of a thousand temples,\nFirst, the Kinkaku-ji, the temple of gold, we will visit,\nThen, the Arashiyama, where the bamboo groves will whisper to us,\nAnd in the night, the tea ceremony will be our solemn pleasure,\n\nNext, we will travel to Nara, where the deer roam free,\nThe Todai-ji, the great Buddha will greet us with his majesty,\nIn the heart of the city, the Naramachi, the old town will unfold,\n\nFrom Nara, we will proceed to Osaka, the city of culinary delights,\nThe castle of Osaka will be our guide to history,\nAnd in the Dotonbori district, the nightlife will be our delight,\n\nLastly, we will return to Tokyo, where our journey will conclude,\nWith the memories of our travels in this fair land, we will be filled,\nAnd with hearts full of joy, we will bid farewell to Japan, the land of the rising sun,\n\nThus, our journey in the land of the rising sun shall be complete,\nWith every step, a tale of beauty and culture we will collect,\nAnd when we return, we will have stories to tell,\nOf the wonders we saw and the memories that will dwell.", "logprobs": [{"token": "Let", "logprob": -3.3119540214538574}, {"token": " us", "logprob": -0.9517306685447693}, {"token": " begin", "logprob": -2.7453198432922363}, {"token": " with", "logprob": -1.7596172094345093}, {"token": " the", "logprob": -0.877091109752655}, {"token": " city", "logprob": -1.714357614517212}, {"token": " of", "logprob": -0.04765528440475464}, {"token": " Tokyo", "logprob": -0.23948262631893158}, {"token": ",", "logprob": -0.026332145556807518}, {"token": "